New preprint! [Our new study](https://doi.org/10.64898/2026.11.20.768032) on the community effects of evolution in a single key species across a resource-antibiotic landscape is out. The community changed differently in different parts of the landscape, so studying the effects of evolution in a single environment can be misleading. This is also Inga-Katariina's first lead-author paper, congrats!
